UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"q": "Is Claude better than ChatGPT?", "a": "It depends on the task. Claude generally produces strong long-form writing and can handle very long documents accurately with its 1M-token context window. ChatGPT has more features (image generation, voice, plugins) and a larger app ecosystem. Coding capability varies by model and task, so it's worth testing both for your specific workflow."}, {"q": "Which is free — ChatGPT or Claude?", "a": "Both have free plans. Claude's Free plan gives access to Sonnet and Haiku models at no cost, with usage caps that reset on a rolling basis. ChatGPT also offers a free tier with its own usage limits. Claude's paid entry point is the Pro plan at $20/month billed monthly, or $17/month if billed annually."}, {"q": "Which AI is better for coding — ChatGPT or Claude?", "a": "Both are strong choices. Claude Opus 5.5 is built for complex agentic coding, with all current Claude models offering a 1M-token context window that helps across large codebases. ChatGPT with code interpreter excels at data analysis and running code. Which is better will depend on the specific coding task and workflow."}]$x$::jsonb
